              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">Whenever this model is required to roll a Size or Ki Test, you may choose to roll a Move Test instead.
Use the same Challenge Number (For Challenge Tests) or against the Opponent&apos;s normal statistic roll (For Opposed Tests).
The Success or Failure on the Move Test replaces the original test.

This model may not be given Enhancement Cards.

If recruited into the same Warband as Itsunagi, this model gains Kurouma Koryu.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
