              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">Each time this model gains an Impetuous Marker, place an Impetuous Marker on another Friendly Ito Clan model, and this model gains 1 Ki Token.</characteristic>
