              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model&apos;s Melee Pool cannot be modified by States.

In the Starting Phase you may choose one of the following abilities:
- When allocating Blood of Orochi Tokens this model may spend Ki Tokens to allocate additional Blood of Orochi Tokens to the pool at one Ki Token per Blood of Orochi Token. 
- For each Blood of Orochi token allocated to this model during the Starting Phase, it gains a Ki Token.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
