      <profiles>
        <profile name="Cold Blood" id="c5b3-0116-27df-2ff0" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">During the Starting Phase, one Friendly model that is allocated any Blood of Orochi Tokens may exchange one Blood of Orochi Token for a Virtue Token.

When a Friendly model spends a Virtue Token you may choose one of the following effects:
- This model gains a Ki Token.
- This model&apos;s Melee and Ranged Pools cannot be reduced by States until the End Phase.
- After this model is Moved or Placed by an Enemy Effect, once the Effect is resolved, you may Place this model within 2&quot; of its current location. This model may be Placed into BtB with an Enemy model using this ability.

Permitted [Acolyte, Asura, Hebimiman, Snake]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
