                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">While this model has maximum Ki Tokens, when it would mark Wounds, it may instead remove one Ki Token for each Wound that would be marked.
Once all Ki Tokens have been used this way, any remaining Wounds are marked as normal.

Requirement [Ito Itsunagi]</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
