          <profiles>
            <profile name="Jade Witch" id="4b26-813c-8f10-34da" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">When the Attached model Targets a Soulless model with a Ki Feat, the Ki Feat loses OppKi.

When the Attached model performs a Simple Ki Feat Action, this model gains a Spell Token.
Once the Attached model has two Spell Tokens, remove 2 Spell Tokens to gain a third Activation Counter that turn but it must perform a Simple Ki Feat Action during that Activation with the Ki cost, excluding Ki Boost, reduced to zero. This additional Activation does not grant a Spell Token.

For effects that count the number of Friendly Shisai, Friendly Shisai models count as 2 Shisai (it does not count as 2 models for any other purpose). 

Requirement [Ayako]</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
